Internal Release Engineering Docs
==================================

The files in this directory are **internal TurnKey release engineering
documents**. They are not end-user or contributor documentation.

They document the process used by the core TurnKey team to perform major
release transitions — setting up full build infrastructure, publishing
bootstraps, creating AMIs, and so on. They assume deep familiarity with
TurnKey's internal infrastructure.

Files
-----

- ``complete``: Full build infrastructure setup from scratch
- ``release-checklist``: Pre-release QA checklist
- ``transition-part1``: Build chain setup (i386 host)
- ``transition-part2``: Build chain setup (amd64 VM) and package archive
- ``transition-part3``: Core Amazon EC2 EBS builds
- ``transition-part4``: Build masters from core; publish iso + ec2
